#, fuzzy
msgid "Funqy HTTP Binding with AWS Lambda "
msgstr "Funqy 与 AWS Lambda 的 HTTP 绑定"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you want to allow HTTP clients to invoke on your Funqy functions on AWS Lambda, Quarkus allows you to expose multiple\n"
"Funqy functions through HTTP deployed as one AWS Lambda.  This approach does add overhead over the\n"
"regular Funqy AWS Lambda integration and also requires you to use AWS API Gateway."
msgstr "如果您希望允许 HTTP 客户端调用您在 AWS Lambda 上部署的 Funqy 函数，Quarkus 支持您通过 HTTP 方式将多个 Funqy 函数作为单个 AWS Lambda 函数进行部署。这种方法相较于常规的 Funqy AWS Lambda 集成确实会增加额外开销，并且还需要您使用 AWS API Gateway。"

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "这项技术被认为是{extension-status}。"

msgid ""
"In _preview_, backward compatibility and presence in the ecosystem is not guaranteed.\n"
"Specific improvements might require changing configuration or APIs, and plans to become _stable_ are under way.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr "在 _preview(预览)_ 中，不保证向后兼容和在生态系统中的存在。具体的改进可能需要改变配置或API，并且正在计划变得 _稳定_ 。欢迎在我们的 link:https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[邮件列表] 中提供反馈，或在我们的 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub问题列表] 中提出问题。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr "如需查看所有可能状态的完整列表，请参阅我们的 link:https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[常见问题解答] 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Follow the xref:aws-lambda-http.adoc[AWS Lambda Http Guide].  It walks through using a variety of HTTP\n"
"frameworks on AWS Lambda, including Funqy."
msgstr "请参考《 xref:aws-lambda-http.adoc[AWS Lambda HTTP 指南] 》。该指南详细介绍了如何在 AWS Lambda 上使用各种 HTTP 框架，包括 Funqy。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "An additional Quickstart"
msgstr "另一份快速入门指南"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Beyond generating an AWS project that is covered in the xref:aws-lambda-http.adoc[AWS Lambda Http Guide],\n"
"there's also a quickstart for running Funqy HTTP on AWS Lambda."
msgstr "除了创建《 xref:aws-lambda-http.adoc[AWS Lambda HTTP 指南] 》中介绍的 AWS 项目外，还有一份关于在 AWS Lambda 上运行 Funqy HTTP 的快速入门指南。"

msgid "Clone the Git repository: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}`, or download an {quickstarts-archive-url}[archive]."
msgstr "克隆 Git 仓库: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}` ，或下载一个 {quickstarts-archive-url}[存档] 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The solution is located in the `funqy-amazon-lambda-quickstart` link:{quickstarts-tree-url}/funqy-quickstarts/funqy-amazon-lambda-http-quickstart[directory]."
msgstr "该解决方案位于 `funqy-amazon-lambda-quickstart` link:{quickstarts-tree-url}/funqy-quickstarts/funqy-amazon-lambda-http-quickstart[目录] 中。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The Code"
msgstr "《守则》"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There is nothing special about the code and more importantly nothing AWS specific.  Funqy functions can be deployed to many\n"
"environments and AWS Lambda is one of them.  The Java code is actually the same exact code as the link:{quickstarts-tree-url}/funqy-quickstarts/funqy-http-quickstart[funqy-http-quickstart]."
msgstr "这段代码并没有什么特别之处，更重要的是，它并不针对 AWS 进行过任何特殊处理。Funqy 函数可以部署到许多环境中，AWS Lambda 就是其中之一。这段 Java 代码实际上与 link:{quickstarts-tree-url}/funqy-quickstarts/funqy-http-quickstart[funqy-http-quickstart] 中的代码完全相同。"

msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "入门指南"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The steps to get this quickstart running are exactly the same as defined in the xref:aws-lambda-http.adoc[AWS Lambda HTTP Guide].\n"
"These differences are that you are running from a quickstart and the maven dependencies are slightly different."
msgstr "运行此快速入门指南的步骤与《 xref:aws-lambda-http.adoc[AWS Lambda HTTP 指南] 》中所述完全一致。区别仅在于您是从快速入门指南开始运行的，且 Maven 依赖项略有不同。"
